{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR Overlay System (vrOS)</strong> delivers meaningful quality-of-life improvements for <strong>PCVR users and professional content creators</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with a strong focus on <strong>social VR creators</strong>, vrOS brings essential VR tools together into a <strong>single, cohesive, high-performance system</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>playspace adjustment</strong> and <strong>OSC messaging</strong>, to <strong>avatar state awareness</strong>, <strong>window capture</strong>, and <strong>streaming utilities</strong>, vrOS eliminates the friction of juggling multiple compositor layers or constantly breaking immersion to manage the desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system is built for <strong>resilience and long-running stability</strong>. Each overlay runs independently, helping prevent crashes from cascading across your VR session\u2014so a single failure won\u2019t take everything down with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, vrOS features a <strong>custom-built overlay application framework</strong>, designed from the ground up for real VR workflows. This architecture enables smooth transitions between desktop and VR modes, while prioritizing performance, reliability, and continuous use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built by VR gamers, for VR gamers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access feedback and playtest coordination are handled primarily through <strong>Discord</strong> for the fastest response and iteration.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3873610?t=1768901127","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873610/67c96212085bb92567f9b511dfb9264796b5d34c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768901127","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873610/f3d8333e908447f0a607013177168cbc704b8038/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768901127","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873610/f3d8333e908447f0a607013177168cbc704b8038/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768901127","categories":[{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR Overlay System (vrOS)</strong> delivers meaningful quality-of-life improvements for <strong>PCVR users and professional content creators</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with a strong focus on <strong>social VR creators</strong>, vrOS brings essential VR tools together into a <strong>single, cohesive, high-performance system</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>playspace adjustment</strong> and <strong>OSC messaging</strong>, to <strong>avatar state awareness</strong>, <strong>window capture</strong>, and <strong>streaming utilities</strong>, vrOS eliminates the friction of juggling multiple compositor layers or constantly breaking immersion to manage the desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system is built for <strong>resilience and long-running stability</strong>. Each overlay runs independently, helping prevent crashes from cascading across your VR session\u2014so a single failure won\u2019t take everything down with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, vrOS features a <strong>custom-built overlay application framework</strong>, designed from the ground up for real VR workflows. This architecture enables smooth transitions between desktop and VR modes, while prioritizing performance, reliability, and continuous use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built by VR gamers, for VR gamers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access feedback and playtest coordination are handled primarily through <strong>Discord</strong> for the fastest response and iteration.</p>","developers":["catnet systems"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"},{"description":"Video Production","id":"58"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873610/9a43e913c5b679cd8b19439eacb90ddb43507c2a/header.jpg?t=1768901127","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 catnet systems \uff5e all rights reserved<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVRChat is a trademark of VRChat Inc. and is not affiliated with or endorsed by this product.<br />\r\nOBS is a trademark of the OBS Project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by this product.<br />\r\nDiscord is a trademark of Discord Inc. and is not affiliated with or endorsed by this product.<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Cluster nodes and VR support</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Cluster nodes and VR support</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes